  "title": "UniJEPA and PSG-JEPA: Unified and Physically Grounded Joint-Embedding Predictive Architectures",
  "summary": "UniJEPA introduces a unified JEPA framework that jointly learns photometric prediction and temporal prediction in a shared latent space, enabling compact and efficient world modeling. PSG-JEPA adds two complementary grounding objectives beyond forward prediction, improving physical state grounding and enabling zero-shot planning. These models are designed for both image and video-level world modeling.",
