      "statement": "UniJEPA jointly learns photometric prediction and temporal prediction in a single shared latent space.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "UniJEPA achieves performance comparable to task-specific JEPAs while requiring a single loss hyperparameter.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "UniJEPA enables zero-shot planning by treating goal features as prediction targets.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
